Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:03:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 273/333] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the pin-family
 dialog (0272)

Dragging a lead onto Pinned or into a project now asks like the pin button,
and a family pinned by a drop lands at the drop spot. The newest click's
family read wins. Reordering a pinned family rewrites its sessions' pin
values to follow the lead. The dialog checks pin spots before asking, keeps
its wording while it closes, and a pinned family session stays fixed even
when reordering is off.
